{"id":1140303,"chapter_id":1140303,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"遗物调查报告","content":"“已将带回的遗物逐一排查，除生活用品外发现一片黑色碎布，碎布上检测到超额狂厄残留，已交由FAC继续研究。”","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"遗物调查报告","content":"“另发现一枚狼牙项链，保存完好，指纹痕迹与禁闭者S-076相符，疑似为禁闭者旧物，留由局长处置……”","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"此次外出调查并未有多少收获，正当你为狂厄武器发愁时，文件堆里传来一阵窸窸窣窣的声响。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"？？","content":"吱吱吱！吱吱吱！","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"一团黑白相间的毛球从你办公桌的文件堆里钻出来。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"options":["来人啊！有老鼠！","是谁的宠物？"],"style":6,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303006,"trial_step":6,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"来人啊！有老鼠！","goto":7},{"text":"是谁的宠物？","goto":9}]},{"step":7,"speaker":"？？","content":"吱吱吱吱！！！","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"毛球愤怒地抬起头，原来是狼獾的宠物阿皮。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303008,"trial_step":8,"next":[10]},{"step":9,"content":"这不是狼獾肩膀上的阿皮吗？你怎么跑到这里来了？","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303009,"trial_step":9,"next":[10]},{"step":10,"speaker":"阿皮","content":"吱！","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"见你认出了它，它爬到你的文件上，指了指文件上狼獾的入狱照，用嘴叼住你的袖子拽了拽。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"狼獾？他怎么了？","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"阿皮继续用自己全身的力道，试图把你拽走。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303013,"trial_step":13,"next":[14]},{"step":14,"options":["狼獾找我？"],"style":6,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303014,"trial_step":14,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"狼獾找我？","goto":15}]},{"step":15,"content":"阿皮点了点头，对着空气一顿比划，你并没能看懂它的意思。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"content":"看来还是跟着阿皮一起去看看比较好。顺便……你也有东西正好要交给狼獾。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"跟随阿皮来到院子里，狼獾独自坐在高墙墙头，面向着锈河的方向。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"content":"阿皮灵活地爬上墙回到主人肩头，报告自己完成了任务。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"options":["你在这么高的地方干什么？"],"style":6,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303019,"trial_step":19,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你在这么高的地方干什么？","goto":20}]},{"step":20,"content":"他答非所问地指了指自己的鼻子。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"这儿，没事了吧？","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"options":["你是问拉比什吗？","你的鼻子怎么了？"],"style":6,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303022,"trial_step":22,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你是问拉比什吗？","goto":23},{"text":"你的鼻子怎么了？","goto":25}]},{"step":23,"content":"拉比什已经没事了，领了一笔赔偿金似乎还挺开心的。","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"啧，谁关心那个混蛋啊……我问的是你的鼻子！审查室里，我给了你一拳。","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303024,"trial_step":24,"next":[26]},{"step":25,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"啧，蠢死了……我问的是你的鼻子！审查室里，我给了你一拳。","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303025,"trial_step":25,"next":[26]},{"step":26,"content":"你不提我都快忘了，这点小伤早就痊愈了。","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"哦……那个，对不起。","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"狼獾不自在地撇了撇嘴，不敢直视你。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"还有……我失控了，没遵守出发前的约定，对不起。","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"content":"狼獾道歉时依旧傲慢，头也不抬，一直望向锈河的方向。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"options":["原谅狼獾","不接受道歉"],"style":6,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303031,"trial_step":31,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"原谅狼獾","goto":32},{"text":"不接受道歉","goto":35}]},{"step":32,"content":"既然已经知道错了，那下不为例。","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"就、就这样？\n……你果然跟他一样奇怪。","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"不管发生什么，好像只要一说“对不起”这三个字，就什么都可以原谅。","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303034,"trial_step":34,"next":[38]},{"step":35,"content":"你这个态度，可完全不像是知错的样子。","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"对、不、起。","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"不就是这三个字吗，怎么和他一样斤斤计较的。","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303037,"trial_step":37,"next":[38]},{"step":38,"content":"和“他”一样？你指的是汉克吗？你在审查室里唯独听我的，也是因为我像他吗？","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"你别多想，谁说我听你的了！只不过是跟汉克有一样的臭毛病而已，有什么好得意的……","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"speaker":"汉克","content":"喂，小子！你怎么不穿衣服啊？你爸爸妈妈呢？","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"speaker":"汉克","content":"这怎么还四脚着地呢，不会是个野娃娃吧……诶诶诶，你咬我干嘛！","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"speaker":"小狼獾","content":"嗷呜——","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"speaker":"汉克","content":"想吃肉是吧，我给你烤！你先松口！","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"汉克好不容易挣脱，转身从自己的破烂里翻出一大块被层报纸保护起来的肉，搁在滚烫的石板上发出冒油的滋滋声。","style":3,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"speaker":"汉克","content":"啧啧啧，这块肉可是好东西啊，爷爷我这么以德报怨的好心人可不多见了啊，你刚刚咬我一口的事怎么说？","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"speaker":"小狼獾","content":"……嗷呜？","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"speaker":"汉克","content":"忘了，你是个野娃娃，不会说话。来，跟我念——对不起，爷爷，你是好人，我不该咬你。","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"speaker":"小狼獾","content":"……","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"speaker":"汉克","content":"看来太长了……来，跟着念——对、不、起。","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"小狼獾","content":"最、唔、起……","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"speaker":"汉克","content":"对、不、起。","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"speaker":"小狼獾","content":"最、唔、起？","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"speaker":"汉克","content":"……算了，先原谅你了，我以后慢慢教你吧。","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"speaker":"小狼獾","content":"最！唔！起！","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"speaker":"汉克","content":"行了行了，吃肉吃肉！","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"呵……","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"content":"你听见高墙上的少年发出一声愉快的轻哼，但除了冷笑，你从来没听见狼獾笑过。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"options":["你刚才笑了？！","一定是听错了"],"style":6,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303058,"trial_step":58,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你刚才笑了？！","goto":59},{"text":"一定是听错了","goto":62}]},{"step":59,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"我？","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"content":"你和阿皮同时重重地点了点头。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"哦，可能吧……刚刚，我在想小时候的事。","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303061,"trial_step":61,"next":[66]},{"step":62,"content":"肯定是阿皮在笑，绝对不是你！","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"你该去治治耳朵了……","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"content":"所以真的是你？","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"怎么，不能笑啊！我只是……在想小时候的事。","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303065,"trial_step":65,"next":[66]},{"step":66,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"在黑帮被训练了太久，又一个人生活了一阵，很多事都忘记了。","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"遇到你之后，又想起来一些。","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"speaker":"流浪汉","content":"哈哈哈哈大家来看呐，老野种带着小野种，在玩过家家呢！","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"content":"流浪汉远远冲狼獾丢了颗石子。","style":3,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"speaker":"流浪汉","content":"诶，小怪物，过来求求我，我给你们爷俩分肉吃啊！","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"content":"小狼獾愤怒地呲牙，眼看就要扑上去咬断流浪汉的脖子。","style":3,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"speaker":"汉克","content":"狼獾，停下！","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"speaker":"小狼獾","content":"死！","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"speaker":"汉克","content":"多大点事，咱自己找肉吃，别理他！","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"流浪汉","content":"你可吹牛吧！连冬天的存粮都给这小畜生吃了，你还剩啥吃的？吃垃圾吗？哈哈哈哈。","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"speaker":"小狼獾","content":"杀！","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"speaker":"汉克","content":"又来了又来了，怎么天天喊打喊杀。给你取个动物名字还真把自己当动物了？","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"speaker":"汉克","content":"记不记得爷爷跟你说过什么，你跟动物的区别是——","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"speaker":"小狼獾","content":"……","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"speaker":"汉克","content":"你看看，一会不提醒又忘了——你不能冲动！冲动是魔鬼！","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"speaker":"流浪汉","content":"哟，你知道冲动怎么写吗？净在这扯呢！","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"speaker":"汉克","content":"关你屁事！咱狼獾长大之后，自己学会了教给我不行啊！","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"喂，局……那谁！","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"content":"狼獾在高墙上灵活地调整了姿势面向你。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"你知道“冲动”怎么写吗？","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"content":"当然，你想学写字？","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"别的不想学，只学“冲动”这两个字不行吗？","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"content":"你还没完全理解狼獾的意思，一个黑影从身后窜了出来——","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"speaker":"德莫莉","content":"嘿，局长！！！！","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"content":"女孩的嗓门极大，你被吓得一激灵。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"content":"德莫莉？你什么时候在这里的？","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"speaker":"德莫莉","content":"刚来的，不过狼獾在那么高的地方应该早就注意到我了吧？","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"是呵——呜——安，獾！","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"content":"狼獾叉着手背过身，因自己对话被打断颇有不满。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"speaker":"德莫莉","content":"你坐在墙上干什么？哦哦，我知道，你一定也跟我一样，热爱思考人生的意义。这人生呐，就跟捡垃圾一样……","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"options":["打断她"],"style":6,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303096,"trial_step":96,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"打断她","goto":97}]},{"step":97,"content":"德莫莉！你来找我什么事？","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"speaker":"德莫莉","content":"差点忘了！我来找局长喝酒！还有不少人等着你呢，快走快走！","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"content":"德莫莉拉着你就要离开。狼獾装作没听见似的，背着声，没有任何挽留的意思。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"options":["邀请狼獾"],"style":6,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303100,"trial_step":100,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"邀请狼獾","goto":101}]},{"step":101,"content":"狼獾，你要不要跟我们一起？","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"speaker":"德莫莉","content":"对哦，好主意啊！他从来没参加过我们的活动呢！","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"不去。我不认识他们。","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"options":["诱惑他","用激将法"],"style":6,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303104,"trial_step":104,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"诱惑他","goto":105},{"text":"用激将法","goto":110}]},{"step":105,"content":"你不是想学写字吗？你去了我就教你“冲动”怎么写。","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"切，那我去问别人。","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"content":"酒会上有很多好吃的！","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"content":"阿皮咽了咽口水，但狼獾还是不为所动。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"content":"看来只能使出绝招了。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303109,"trial_step":109,"next":[115]},{"step":110,"content":"你该不会是怕了吧？","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303110,"trial_step":110},{"step":111,"content":"毕竟喝醉之后，更容易失控。就算学会并抄写“冲动”一百遍也没有用。","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303111,"trial_step":111},{"step":112,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"会让人失控的肯定不是好东西！我才不上当！","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303112,"trial_step":112},{"step":113,"content":"他明显急了，但还不肯松口。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303113,"trial_step":113},{"step":114,"content":"看来是时候使出绝招了。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303114,"trial_step":114,"next":[115]},{"step":115,"content":"测试音效的打断逻辑","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":115,"course":6},{"step":116,"content":"播放一个长音效，会有个前奏，稍等一会儿。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":115,"course":6},{"step":117,"content":"播放相同音效，会继续延续。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":115,"course":6},{"step":118,"content":"暂停配置音效，这里测试一下打断。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":115,"course":6},{"step":119,"content":"播放一个稍短的音效，在这里等待它结束。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":115,"course":6},{"step":120,"content":"配置同名音效，看能否再次播放。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":115,"course":6},{"step":121,"content":"结束测试。","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":115,"course":6},{"step":122,"content":"他们收拾汉克遗物的时候发现了一个狼牙项链，不知道是不是……","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303116,"trial_step":116},{"step":123,"content":"没等你说完，狼獾从墙上一跃而下。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303117,"trial_step":117},{"step":124,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"去。","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303118,"trial_step":118},{"step":125,"speaker":"德莫莉","content":"万岁！","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303119,"trial_step":119},{"step":126,"content":"狼獾还没站稳就拿过你手里的盒子打开，一条狼牙项链静静地躺在里面。狼牙微微泛黄，被绑在皮绳上，做工粗糙。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303120,"trial_step":120},{"step":127,"content":"赫卡蒂他们清理现场时，发现了狂厄武器交易的线索，还有这个项链。","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303121,"trial_step":121},{"step":128,"options":["你之前似乎也在找它"],"style":6,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303122,"trial_step":122,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你之前似乎也在找它","goto":123}]},{"step":129,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"……是。","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303123,"trial_step":123},{"step":130,"content":"据发现的人说，它被藏在小盒子里保护得很好，应该是很重要的东西吧？","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303124,"trial_step":124},{"step":131,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"臭老头给我的，知道他要把我卖给黑帮之后，就赌气扔了。","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303125,"trial_step":125},{"step":132,"content":"狼獾吹了吹狼牙上的灰尘。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303126,"trial_step":126},{"step":133,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"也不知道从哪捡回来的……","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303127,"trial_step":127},{"step":134,"speaker":"小狼獾","content":"汉克，你在干嘛？","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303128,"trial_step":128},{"step":135,"speaker":"汉克","content":"嘿嘿，在给你做礼物，看看，喜不喜欢？","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303129,"trial_step":129},{"step":136,"speaker":"小狼獾","content":"不要礼物，要肉。","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303130,"trial_step":130},{"step":137,"speaker":"汉克","content":"一年前的今天是我捡到你的日子，也算是你生日，肉哪有礼物有心意？","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303131,"trial_step":131},{"step":138,"speaker":"小狼獾","content":"是你打不到肉。","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303132,"trial_step":132},{"step":139,"speaker":"汉克","content":"没良心的小东西，如果咱俩真要饿死了，我第一个把你卖了换钱！","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303133,"trial_step":133},{"step":140,"speaker":"小狼獾","content":"不好。","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303134,"trial_step":134},{"step":141,"speaker":"汉克","content":"有啥不好的！你投奔了别人，还能吃饱喝足，我巴不得有人把我也卖了！","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303135,"trial_step":135},{"step":142,"speaker":"小狼獾","content":"不好！","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303136,"trial_step":136},{"step":143,"speaker":"汉克","content":"哈哈哈哈哈开玩笑的，咋还生气了？也不知道像谁，小心眼……喏，项链还要不要了？","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303137,"trial_step":137},{"step":144,"speaker":"小狼獾","content":"要！","style":1,"background":1028,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303138,"trial_step":138},{"step":145,"content":"狼獾看着手里项链，有些出神。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303139,"trial_step":139},{"step":146,"content":"曾经最想让狼獾成为人类的人，在得知他被黑帮当做狩猎工具训练时，是以怎样的心情找回这条项链的？","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303140,"trial_step":140},{"step":147,"content":"那一刻，汉克是不是也后悔了呢？","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303141,"trial_step":141},{"step":148,"content":"你们可能没有机会知道这个答案了。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303142,"trial_step":142},{"step":149,"speaker":"德莫莉","content":"你们俩磨蹭什么呢！快点快点！酒要被她们喝光了！","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303143,"trial_step":143},{"step":150,"content":"我们走吧，狼獾！","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303144,"trial_step":144},{"step":151,"content":"狼獾将项链收好，跟上你的脚步，迈向未知的人和风景。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303145,"trial_step":145},{"step":152,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"嗯，来了。","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":240303146,"trial_step":146}]}